  "body": "## What's Changed\r\n* Add ui.theme config by @daewon in https://github.com/lusingander/stu/pull/96\r\n* Preserve list view state on refresh by @daewon in https://github.com/lusingander/stu/pull/98\r\n* Render region into header by @fgebhart in https://github.com/lusingander/stu/pull/103\r\n* Update GitHub Actions workflows by @lusingander in https://github.com/lusingander/stu/pull/104\r\n* Update dependencies by @lusingander in https://github.com/lusingander/stu/pull/109\r\n* Update mdBook by @lusingander in https://github.com/lusingander/stu/pull/108\r\n* Adopt GitHub Actions dependency lockfile by @lusingander in https://github.com/lusingander/stu/pull/110\r\n* Update GitHub Actions workflows by @lusingander in https://github.com/lusingander/stu/pull/111\r\n* Update screenshots by @lusingander in https://github.com/lusingander/stu/pull/112\r\n* Remove unused dependencies and features by @lusingander in https://github.com/lusingander/stu/pull/113\r\n* Update laurier and trim TUI dependency features by @lusingander in https://github.com/lusingander/stu/pull/114\r\n* Add terminal E2E tests for core S3 workflows by @lusingander in https://github.com/lusingander/stu/pull/115\r\n* Fix CI by @lusingander in https://github.com/lusingander/stu/pull/116\r\n* Expand terminal E2E coverage for refresh, navigation, and downloads by @lusingander in https://github.com/lusingander/stu/pull/117\r\n* Expand terminal E2E scenarios by @lusingander in https://github.com/lusingander/stu/pull/118\r\n* Expand terminal E2E scenarios by @lusingander in https://github.com/lusingander/stu/pull/119\r\n* Filter object versions by exact key by @lusingander in https://github.com/lusingander/stu/pull/120\r\n* Update MSRV to 1.94.1\r\n\r\n## New Contributors\r\n* @daewon made their first contribution in https://github.com/lusingander/stu/pull/96\r\n* @fgebhart made their first contribution in https://github.com/lusingander/stu/pull/103\r\n\r\n**Full Changelog**: https://github.com/lusingander/stu/compare/v0.7.6...v0.8.0",
